# The harvested IMAGES stay on this machine (~500 MiB of fonts, theme bitmaps, hives).
# What belongs in the repository is the EVIDENCE: reports, manifests and extraction
# scripts, so any number in wubu_gui_metrics.h traces back to a real file in a real ISO.
*
!.gitignore
!**/REPORT.md
!**/MANIFEST.tsv
!**/*.py
!**/*.sh
